   "panels": [
    "expressions.expression.mischievous"
   ],
   "note": "The panel winks the dog's right eye (the sheet's left) and turns the head about halfway to three-quarter (panels.json), so the nose sits off the eyes' middle: 28.4 pt from the right eye and 17.5 pt from the left, against the turnaround's 23.5 and 22.6."
  },
  "content": {
   "panels": [],
   "note": "No record: the dog's expression sheet (and every species' sheet) draws no Content panel. The one panel with content's happy eyes and smile is Proud, which raises the chin; holding content to it would hold a level face to a raised one. Judged by eye at Gate A until the founder names a panel (question for QUESTIONS.md)."
  },
  "sleepy": {
   "panels": [
    "expressions.expression.sleepy"
   ],
   "note": "The Sleepy expression (lying, chin on its paws, eyes closed): sleepy's 'then closed' eyes are held. Its mouth is a short 人, judged by eye. Not the Sleepy face assembly, whose label pairs it with drooped ears (R3)."
  },
  "listening": {
   "panels": [
    "expressions.ears.lifted-slightly"
   ],
   "note": "Lifted slightly is the dog's lifted ears (Forward and Perked are the other species' names). It draws a head with no face, so nothing is held: the record places the render beside it, on the head's top, for the eyes of the agent and the founder."
  },
